Edit the data collection rule associated with the servers and use an XPath query to collect only the required event IDs.
説明
This answer is correct. Data collection rules define what the Azure Monitor Agent gathers, and the Windows event log data source accepts XPath expressions that filter by channel and event ID. Because the rule is associated with the machines centrally, updating it changes collection on all 400 servers without touching them individually.
