説明
This answer is incorrect. Manually configuring policies in the portal does not meet the infrastructure as code requirement, and DSC scripts are designed for configuring operating system state on virtual machines, not for defining or deploying Azure Policy definitions and assignments.
正解
Author the Azure Policy definitions and assignments as Bicep templates stored in a Git repository, and configure an Azure DevOps pipeline that runs Azure Resource Manager deployment commands to deploy the templates to each subscription after a pull request is approved.
説明
