全体的な説明
Implementing security controls by using infrastructure as code means defining Azure Policy definitions and assignments in template files (such as Bicep or ARM JSON) that are stored in source control and deployed through an automated CI/CD pipeline, ensuring consistency, auditability, and repeatable governance across environments. Option 1 is the only choice that fully satisfies the version control, approval, and automated deployment requirements described in the scenario.
