Microsoft Defender for Storage can be configured at both the subscription level and the individual resource level, giving administrators flexibility to enable protection selectively. In this scenario, enabling the plan directly on storesensitive01 at the resource level satisfies the requirement to protect only that account while avoiding unnecessary cost and scanning on the other 59 storage accounts.
